Shiki Office — Third-party software notice
Shiki Office 第三者ソフトウェアに関する告知
=============================================

Shiki Office is built by Imanect Labs from the unmodified source code of the
open-source projects listed below. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or
endorsed by Collabora Productivity Ltd. or The Document Foundation.
"Collabora", "Collabora Online" and "Collabora Office" are trademarks of
Collabora Productivity Ltd. "LibreOffice" is a trademark of The Document
Foundation. They are mentioned here only to identify the upstream source.

Shiki Office は、以下のオープンソース・プロジェクトのソースコードを改変せずに
Imanect Labs がビルドしたものです。Collabora Productivity Ltd. および
The Document Foundation とは提携・後援・推奨の関係にありません。
上記の名称はそれぞれの所有者の商標で、ここではソースの出所を示すためだけに記載しています。


1. Components and source code / 構成要素とソースコード
------------------------------------------------------

Collabora Online (coolwsd) and Collabora Office core (LibreOffice technology)
                                           MPL-2.0
  The core is the engine/ directory of the same repository.
  repository: @ONLINE_REPO@
  tag:        @ONLINE_REF@
  commit:     @ONLINE_COMMIT@
  The user interface translations of the core come from
  repository: @TRANSLATIONS_REPO@
  tag:        @TRANSLATIONS_REF@
  commit:     @TRANSLATIONS_COMMIT@

Spelling dictionaries bundled with the core          various
  /opt/collaboraoffice/share/extensions/dict-*. Each dictionary carries its
  own license file in its directory; some are GPL or LGPL licensed. Their
  source is part of the core source above (engine/dictionaries).

Poco C++ Libraries                         BSL-1.0
  Built as part of the core from its source archive (listed in
  core-external-tarballs.sha256 below) and linked statically.
  license:    poco-LICENSE (in this directory)
  The Poco source archive also contains the following libraries:
    PCRE2      BSD-3-Clause   license: /usr/share/doc/libpcre2-8-0/copyright
    zlib       Zlib           license: /usr/share/doc/zlib1g/copyright
    Expat      MIT            license: /usr/share/doc/libexpat1/copyright
    utf8proc   MIT            license: /usr/share/doc/libutf8proc3/copyright
  (The referenced files are the license texts and copyright notices of the
  same upstream projects as packaged by Ubuntu.)

Third-party libraries bundled into the core (ICU, NSS, OpenSSL, curl, cairo,
fonts and others), as source archives with their sha256:
  core-external-tarballs.sha256 (in this directory)
  Upstream: https://gerrit.collaboraoffice.com/src/ and
            https://gerrit.collaboraoffice.com/extern/

Ubuntu 24.04 packages in this image (source package and version):
  ubuntu-source-packages.txt (in this directory)
  Archive state used: ubuntu-snapshot.txt (in this directory), available at
  https://snapshot.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/<that timestamp>/


2. License texts / ライセンス文書
-------------------------------

  /opt/collaboraoffice/LICENSE, LICENSE.html, NOTICE, CREDITS.fodt
  /usr/share/doc/coolwsd/THIRDPARTYLICENSES
  Poco: see "Poco C++ Libraries" above
  /usr/share/doc/*/copyright            (Ubuntu packages)


3. Complete corresponding source / 対応するソース一式
------------------------------------------------

The complete corresponding source code of everything listed above, including
the Ubuntu packages, is provided as the container image

  shiki-collabora:@ONLINE_REF@-@BUILD_ID@-sources

which is delivered together with this image (build @BUILD_ID@).

上記すべて（Ubuntu パッケージを含む）の対応するソース一式は、本イメージと一緒に
提供されるコンテナイメージ shiki-collabora:@ONLINE_REF@-@BUILD_ID@-sources に収録しています。
